WEBVTT


00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.300
So the Lord God banished him
from the garden of Eden


00:00:16.401 --> 00:00:20.000
to serve the ground from which
he had been taken. Genesis 3:23


00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.360
Eden Log... Eden Log...


00:07:57.204 --> 00:07:59.581
Welcome.


00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:07.746
Whatever you origins may be it is here
where your journey ends.


00:08:07.843 --> 00:08:10.625
Sacrificing what is most important to you -


00:08:10.722 --> 00:08:16.840
your consented efforts make you a natural
candidate for citizenship in our society.


00:08:17.134 --> 00:08:21.040
Eden Log offers you it's passport.


00:10:53.524 --> 00:10:58.220
Capable of entering in the cycle
Eden Log counts you amongst it's own.


00:10:58.392 --> 00:11:02.141
Contract is fair.
It is thanks to your work below


00:11:02.303 --> 00:11:06.013
you'll be able to construct
the paradise above.


00:11:06.225 --> 00:11:09.549
Look after the plant
and it will look after you.


00:11:09.702 --> 00:11:13.934
After this exchange
you'll be called to join us.


00:11:14.069 --> 00:11:17.432
Without any other authority
than of your own will.


00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:23.009
Without any other form of award
than the call of your new life.


00:11:23.493 --> 00:11:26.063
The call.


00:17:53.862 --> 00:17:56.680
Who are you?


00:18:00.989 --> 00:18:04.526
I... I don't know.


00:18:06.376 --> 00:18:09.062
I don't know who I am.


00:18:16.311 --> 00:18:19.867
Stay away!
You awakened it.


00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:26.609
Where... Where are we?


00:18:27.393 --> 00:18:32.842
I don't know how you survived till now
but please get away!


00:18:39.951 --> 00:18:42.240
No.


00:18:44.787 --> 00:18:47.396
Tell me how to get out of here.


00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:50.604
Where do you want to go? Up there?


00:18:50.739 --> 00:18:53.318
There's nothing up there. Nothing!


00:18:53.555 --> 00:18:56.627
It's over, do you hear me?
It's over!


00:18:56.743 --> 00:19:01.162
I put and end to it. Me!
I opened everybody's eyes.


00:19:01.374 --> 00:19:08.874
The whole world will know thanks to me
how much we neeed to pay...


00:19:21.403 --> 00:19:26.949
There is no way out.
Please go away.


00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:33.456
- Did you hear?
- What?


00:19:34.188 --> 00:19:36.120
That!


00:19:36.236 --> 00:19:38.652
It's already too late.


00:19:39.173 --> 00:19:41.124
What was it?


00:19:41.221 --> 00:19:43.059
Your end.


00:19:43.272 --> 00:19:45.552
The end of the man you were.


00:19:45.919 --> 00:19:51.320
Kill yourself.
Believe me. Kill yourself. Quickly.


00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.840
You cannot escape from it!


00:19:55.593 --> 00:20:00.212
I was the architect of this lab.
There's no way out.


00:20:00.386 --> 00:20:03.838
Don't worry.
You won't suffer anymore.


00:20:04.495 --> 00:20:09.876
Go! Go now! Go!


00:24:49.693 --> 00:24:52.840
Access to scientific data authorized.


00:24:53.000 --> 00:24:56.200
Memory re-energizing.


00:24:57.596 --> 00:24:58.828
Open your level.


00:24:58.929 --> 00:25:01.461
Out of the question.
First tell me what all that means.


00:25:01.577 --> 00:25:04.631
Calm down.
You're not qualified for security.


00:25:04.766 --> 00:25:07.090
Just open the REZO to our surveillance.


00:25:07.187 --> 00:25:10.790
The protocol is clear. Access to the REZO
was reserved only to technicians.


00:25:10.906 --> 00:25:12.938
Eden Log protocol
guarantees this.


00:25:12.950 --> 00:25:15.150
There's no way that I can open
the passage to security.


00:25:15.240 --> 00:25:21.028
This is an emergency. Your irresponsible
attitude is itself a breach of contract.


00:25:21.144 --> 00:25:23.488
Plantation is supposed
to be self-managing.


00:25:23.500 --> 00:25:25.833
Surveillance stops at the
collector at level zero. Not below.


00:25:25.949 --> 00:25:28.906
You should let us resolve the problem.


00:25:29.021 --> 00:25:30.840
Resolve the problem!? It's a war below.
Have you seen the pictures?!


00:25:31.000 --> 00:25:35.306
You have no right to prevent workers from
returning up there and answering the call.


00:25:35.422 --> 00:25:37.720
No way!


00:25:38.772 --> 00:25:42.714
You should give us access that is not
in the area of your competence.


00:25:42.810 --> 00:25:46.513
That's what I've been telling you.
It's out of the question


00:25:46.614 --> 00:25:50.217
that the REZO be used for repressive ends.
And certainly not by your guards.


00:25:50.545 --> 00:25:52.840
Do you hear me?


00:25:53.215 --> 00:25:54.840
Do you hear me?


00:25:55.096 --> 00:25:58.014
You are in no position
to lay conditions to the council.


00:25:58.246 --> 00:26:03.702
So long as we receive no information on the
condition of workers already on the surface
no one is using the lifts anymore.


00:26:03.838 --> 00:26:07.962
This discussion is over.
- You are right, the discussion is over.


00:26:12.000 --> 00:26:13.782
Everything is filmed!


00:26:13.918 --> 00:26:17.292
If your screws try to come back in
I'm warning you


00:26:17.393 --> 00:26:20.666
that I'll alert the world above
about what is happening here.


00:26:20.821 --> 00:26:26.038
And the faith reserved by Eden Log for
the immigrant population. There's still laws.


00:26:26.309 --> 00:26:28.840
On position. Everything's ready.


00:26:29.000 --> 00:26:30.860
Then go!


00:26:35.406 --> 00:26:37.976
Try to find a way
to get that working again.


00:26:38.111 --> 00:26:41.243
Request contact with the surface.
What's the situation?


00:26:41.398 --> 00:26:44.077
The elevators are still
blocked in the levels.


00:26:44.193 --> 00:26:46.454
And the plantation?
- It's completely choked up.


00:26:46.570 --> 00:26:49.840
The workers are in a terminal stage.
Gone completely wild.


00:26:49.942 --> 00:26:53.265
That makes the intruder
that much harder to localize.


00:26:53.536 --> 00:26:56.628
Get to the upper level, the rest of you.
On the double!


00:26:56.744 --> 00:26:59.251
The images were being broadcast
throughout the REZO.


00:26:59.386 --> 00:27:02.555
That explains the technician's
obstructing the access.


00:27:02.710 --> 00:27:04.135
It's getting more and more complicated.


00:27:04.270 --> 00:27:06.840
Recover the data from the laboratories.


00:27:07.000 --> 00:27:09.874
The rest is left to your discretion.
- I see.


00:27:10.000 --> 00:27:14.306
Secrecy... Secrecy alone counts.


00:27:14.480 --> 00:27:16.355
You're already on a mission.


00:27:16.471 --> 00:27:19.114
Control of the laboratories
and the technicians.


00:27:19.230 --> 00:27:20.972
Control of the technicians?


00:27:21.088 --> 00:27:24.872
It's a cleanup. And I want images of all that.
Check your recorders.


00:27:25.000 --> 00:27:28.478
The signals that are broadcast
remain a danger for the whole system.


00:27:28.710 --> 00:27:32.840
It's impossible to locate
the technician on level minus 3.


00:27:33.000 --> 00:27:35.840
His knowledge of the gallery
is a serious handicap.


00:27:35.966 --> 00:27:37.029
Get around that.


00:27:37.164 --> 00:27:40.347
The exterior is not yet ready
to accept the secret.


00:27:40.560 --> 00:27:43.308
You've remained it's guardians.


00:27:44.348 --> 00:27:46.396
They've got us. We read you now.


00:27:46.550 --> 00:27:49.924
We neutralize the lab and we
go back down to the plantation.


00:27:50.079 --> 00:27:53.500
We have to locate the architect.
We've got no choice.


00:27:53.635 --> 00:27:58.720
Nothing must leave the galleries anymore.
No signals, no people.


00:28:09.964 --> 00:28:13.000
Memory disconnected.


00:28:18.283 --> 00:28:22.476
Access to scientific data not authorized.


00:30:13.444 --> 00:30:15.618
Check the tunnel.


00:30:15.754 --> 00:30:19.599
I'm starting to get sick and tired
of walking around these tunnels.


00:30:19.754 --> 00:30:22.600
Would you rather get lost in the REZO?


00:30:23.000 --> 00:30:25.704
If that matter
I'm sick of these corridors too.


00:30:25.878 --> 00:30:30.689
I'll be so glad when we get our hands
on that asshole, so we can go back up.


00:32:19.384 --> 00:32:22.840
Great, one more dead-end.


00:32:23.000 --> 00:32:26.368
Let's hope the other crews
are luckier that we've been.


00:32:30.418 --> 00:32:35.840
Access to security data authorized.
Maps loaded.


00:32:36.000 --> 00:32:39.840
We all searched the whole zone.
Further on it gets impossible.


00:32:40.806 --> 00:32:42.958
The others will take care
of that gallery.


00:32:43.059 --> 00:32:45.111
We just have to finish this part here
and the level will be done.


00:32:45.212 --> 00:32:47.261
He's got to be
in the more humid zones anyway.


00:32:47.357 --> 00:32:51.117
Yes, got to be. He's got to be there,
or there, or somewhere else.


00:32:51.491 --> 00:32:54.840
Maybe he's hiding there.
- And what if maybe he changed levels?


00:32:55.000 --> 00:32:58.159
Enough already.
There's no point arguing about it.


00:32:59.263 --> 00:33:04.306
How can he find his way? Dropping
bread crumbs? I don't understand.


00:33:04.403 --> 00:33:06.840
It's the darkness causing that.
The brain lacks oxigen.


00:33:07.000 --> 00:33:09.840
Shut the fuck up!


00:33:11.582 --> 00:33:13.688
At least they don't have anymore problems.


00:33:13.785 --> 00:33:15.799
Tell me how they expect
us to find a runaway


00:33:15.900 --> 00:33:17.814
in a maze that he designed himself?


00:33:17.911 --> 00:33:20.877
That you have to ask...
- Hey, up there!


00:33:21.320 --> 00:33:25.301
He's diverted the evacuation pipe.


00:33:59.084 --> 00:34:01.750
He is into the tunnel.


00:38:43.895 --> 00:38:46.716
It's useless what you are doing.


00:38:57.823 --> 00:39:03.079
I'm sorry about that music. It's the only
thing that seems to calm them down.


00:39:03.640 --> 00:39:06.200
At least a little bit.


00:39:07.691 --> 00:39:11.130
I don't know how much longer
all this can hold together.


00:39:11.227 --> 00:39:14.945
But I sure hope
I'm not here to find out.


00:39:18.848 --> 00:39:21.553
Can you understand what I'm saying?


00:39:22.923 --> 00:39:25.029
Take it easy.


00:39:27.136 --> 00:39:33.174
Don't stay too close to the wall either.
Do you understand or not?


00:39:36.282 --> 00:39:39.645
Up till now I've been able
to manage pretty well.


00:39:39.819 --> 00:39:44.656
And before you showed up, I thought
I was the only one in this situation.


00:39:45.332 --> 00:39:49.840
But if you can't even talk anymore
it means your mutation has already begun.


00:39:50.762 --> 00:39:53.622
And I won't be able to keep you.


00:39:56.523 --> 00:40:01.360
Because this is the only place around
here that's a little protected.


00:40:12.236 --> 00:40:15.753
Hey... are you hungry?


00:40:22.095 --> 00:40:26.404
Wait a second.
Let me see what I've got left.


00:40:59.000 --> 00:41:05.091
And that... It's a guard's harness.
What's a worker doing with that?


00:41:10.331 --> 00:41:12.979
Why don't you want to answer me.


00:41:13.462 --> 00:41:18.011
You'll calm down sooner or later.
Don't worry.


00:41:23.365 --> 00:41:29.320
I've got all the time in the world here.
But you'll be going back outside.


00:41:31.089 --> 00:41:36.326
But before that there's a little
experiment I'd like to try on you.


00:41:36.785 --> 00:41:40.880
Don't worry it's just...


00:41:42.000 --> 00:41:43.840
Stop!


00:41:44.000 --> 00:41:46.720
Let me go.


00:41:47.000 --> 00:41:51.403
But if you can still talk that means
you are not totally lost, you know?


00:41:51.538 --> 00:41:54.920
No. I don't know.
I don't know anything.


00:41:55.575 --> 00:41:58.048
Where are we?


00:41:59.149 --> 00:42:03.285
The cages? You?
What does it mean?


00:42:04.306 --> 00:42:08.017
We're between the plantation,
the workers and the surface.


00:42:08.113 --> 00:42:11.358
The harvest of this down below
and the collector up there.


00:42:11.493 --> 00:42:14.089
We are in the maintenance REZO.
- What's that?


00:42:14.222 --> 00:42:18.208
The plant's maintenace is taken care of
by the REZO technicians.


00:42:18.440 --> 00:42:21.350
Each floor handles a specific job.


00:42:21.486 --> 00:42:24.000
I don't get anything!


00:42:33.910 --> 00:42:39.269
I'm just the REZO's botanist.
I don't understand everything either.


00:42:39.540 --> 00:42:43.965
What I need is to get out of here.


00:42:57.078 --> 00:43:01.000
The workers. They came of that way.


00:43:01.174 --> 00:43:05.674
Drawn by the plant I guess.
The plant fed them.


00:43:05.774 --> 00:43:09.357
But there was no control.
And the dose was too strong.


00:43:09.724 --> 00:43:12.449
That make them rot.


00:43:12.604 --> 00:43:16.222
I told myself my only
chance was to wait


00:43:16.323 --> 00:43:19.840
till hunger drove them start
killing each other


00:43:20.000 --> 00:43:22.853
and I hoped I'd still be alive to see it.


00:43:23.027 --> 00:43:27.438
In the end we grew accustomed
to each other. I've got no illusions.


00:43:27.592 --> 00:43:32.539
If it weren't for these piece of plastic
between us I wouldn't be able to hold on...


00:43:35.667 --> 00:43:39.551
They still manage to surprise me
after all this time.


00:43:40.000 --> 00:43:46.466
But what I can't figure out is how you were
able to excape form the plant's addict.


00:43:48.000 --> 00:43:51.858
Look. It's beautiful, isn't it?


00:43:52.196 --> 00:43:55.384
The sap's energetic
properties are infinite


00:43:55.539 --> 00:43:58.899
and believe me,
we're just at the beginning.


00:43:59.421 --> 00:44:02.126
Let me try a test on you.


00:44:04.760 --> 00:44:09.629
Don't worry, you've got nothing to fear.
Except knowing more about yourself.


00:44:15.000 --> 00:44:18.591
If you're healthy the plant
will try to contaminate you.


00:44:18.727 --> 00:44:21.998
That will set off the alarm
and stop the transfusion.


00:44:24.781 --> 00:44:30.423
You mustn't bear a grudge.
It's as if it were trying to make contact.


00:44:30.674 --> 00:44:33.840
Access to greenhouse authorized.


00:44:34.352 --> 00:44:37.120
Mixture released.


00:44:49.239 --> 00:44:52.504
I'll wind up knowing
what it wants from us.


00:45:04.517 --> 00:45:06.932
What's happening?


00:45:09.232 --> 00:45:11.840
The process is reversing.


00:45:12.151 --> 00:45:14.640
It can't be.


00:45:22.470 --> 00:45:26.360
The plant has always been sterile.
Who are you?


00:45:36.821 --> 00:45:40.783
Wait. They've sensed something.


00:46:12.270 --> 00:46:14.840
We'll take the lab from behind.


00:46:15.000 --> 00:46:20.094
They finally picked up the trail.
It's me they're after.


00:46:22.446 --> 00:46:24.920
Don't move.


00:46:27.251 --> 00:46:29.840
It's simply a safety measure.


00:46:30.382 --> 00:46:33.720
Till you get your wits back.


00:46:51.826 --> 00:46:54.338
Hatch is opening.


00:47:02.461 --> 00:47:07.214
I'm sorry but I can't take the risk
of bringing you with me.


00:51:32.969 --> 00:51:35.829
No! Get away!


00:56:39.679 --> 00:56:43.280
It's not me. It's not me.


00:56:45.302 --> 00:56:47.543
Come on.


01:00:26.797 --> 01:00:29.522
You are not like them.


01:00:32.737 --> 01:00:36.280
I don't understand anything anymore.


01:00:38.346 --> 01:00:40.974
The plant... You...


01:00:50.238 --> 01:00:55.088
The guards going down.
The workers going up.


01:01:57.281 --> 01:01:59.639
An elevator!


01:03:11.463 --> 01:03:13.434
Data damaged.


01:03:13.608 --> 01:03:17.320
Insufficient data.


01:03:19.600 --> 01:03:22.300
Nothing works here anymore.


01:03:38.343 --> 01:03:43.290
Access to scientific data authorized.
Memory re-energizing.


01:03:43.406 --> 01:03:46.947
I am the last technician
before the exit level.


01:03:47.082 --> 01:03:50.682
I don't have much time left.
We were naive.


01:03:51.300 --> 01:03:54.705
We believed
that the cycle was perfect.


01:03:54.879 --> 01:04:00.406
The energy, generated for the outside
is reaching everywhere. And to everyone.


01:04:00.502 --> 01:04:05.854
The men digging underground made
insensitive to the pain of their efforts


01:04:06.000 --> 01:04:09.608
recovered on the surface
thanks to their own hardwork


01:04:09.709 --> 01:04:13.216
earning their place
in this new society.


01:04:13.371 --> 01:04:15.890
The structure is different here!


01:04:17.204 --> 01:04:19.840
It will never hold!


01:04:20.199 --> 01:04:25.640
We knew what we wanted from the plant,
we believed in it's generosity.


01:04:26.000 --> 01:04:29.141
But it's conditioning
was not without risk.


01:04:29.373 --> 01:04:31.789
It's protecting itself from us.


01:04:31.924 --> 01:04:36.855
The workers of the depths went throught
what's happening to me now.


01:04:37.000 --> 01:04:40.840
But I will not end up like them. I have
no other choice but to graft myself to it.


01:04:41.396 --> 01:04:46.387
Only the suction of the plant
can block the mutation


01:04:46.483 --> 01:04:50.040
and nothing can reverse the phenomenon.


01:04:53.445 --> 01:04:56.556
Today I know what the
society does with its sick.


01:04:56.657 --> 01:04:59.667
They never come back down.


01:05:01.213 --> 01:05:06.256
Eden Log probably estimated
that was the price to pay.


01:05:11.000 --> 01:05:16.991
We, the technicians of the REZO
refuse to maintain this line.


01:05:23.205 --> 01:05:29.524
No! It can't be. No!


01:08:07.592 --> 01:08:10.600
They've left everything open.


01:09:04.546 --> 01:09:09.976
Eden Log, forerunner of new energy.


01:09:17.519 --> 01:09:20.939
At first I remember that they said that


01:09:21.040 --> 01:09:25.159
with just one tree
and it's roots exploitation


01:09:25.526 --> 01:09:29.176
they would be able to provide
the energy to entire city.


01:09:30.838 --> 01:09:33.280
And I believe that.


01:09:50.391 --> 01:09:52.845
There!


01:10:38.818 --> 01:10:41.581
It's the collector of the sap.


01:10:44.394 --> 01:10:47.320
The tree is above it.


01:12:08.000 --> 01:12:10.440
The cubes.


01:12:20.828 --> 01:12:23.668
They're connected to the machines.


01:13:24.269 --> 01:13:27.612
Don't go back! Never!


01:13:29.270 --> 01:13:31.840
You don't understand anything!


01:13:32.000 --> 01:13:35.531
People in the cubes.
It's not to cure them.


01:13:36.519 --> 01:13:39.939
The energy they take.
It's not the plant's energy.


01:13:40.074 --> 01:13:42.719
It's people's energy.


01:13:52.000 --> 01:13:54.500
What's this?


01:14:02.000 --> 01:14:04.500
Did you hear that?


01:14:18.416 --> 01:14:20.851
It's...


01:14:24.000 --> 01:14:27.200
It's...


01:14:45.288 --> 01:14:47.720
Sorry.


01:14:59.760 --> 01:15:01.905
No...


01:15:03.721 --> 01:15:06.252
No.


01:15:07.231 --> 01:15:11.080
It's... It's not true.


01:15:12.835 --> 01:15:15.440
Not me.


01:15:16.545 --> 01:15:21.414
After all this time spent here? No!


01:15:44.185 --> 01:15:46.600
It's you.


01:15:47.412 --> 01:15:49.982
It's you.


01:15:51.000 --> 01:15:53.880
You contaminated me.


01:15:58.492 --> 01:16:02.898
It's you
You contaminated me!


01:17:38.167 --> 01:17:40.640
I know...


01:17:41.375 --> 01:17:43.960
I know this place.


01:17:45.143 --> 01:17:48.583
I know this place. I know.


01:18:14.190 --> 01:18:18.403
Go to the surveillance station
and contact the surface.


01:20:05.323 --> 01:20:09.517
Access to scientific data authorized.
Memory loading.


01:20:09.613 --> 01:20:12.289
Laboratory minus 2.


01:20:26.250 --> 01:20:30.366
I have arrived at the plantation.
Request contact.


01:20:30.559 --> 01:20:36.125
It's urgent. I'm not receiving you.
Sending images. I hope that...


01:20:39.864 --> 01:20:42.299
Find the REZO botanists.


01:20:42.415 --> 01:20:47.069
The plant is becoming
more toxic as it grows.


01:20:47.997 --> 01:20:54.297
Apparently the more sap we take out,
the more the plant protects itself.


01:20:55.782 --> 01:20:59.319
Warnings sent to Eden Log
have not been answered.


01:21:01.154 --> 01:21:06.916
The architect of level minus 3, the most
capable of finding his way in the REZO


01:21:07.070 --> 01:21:10.723
decided to go down
to report what's happening.


01:21:14.355 --> 01:21:17.951
Here's what he have been able
to recover of his images.


01:21:27.577 --> 01:21:34.630
Now it's my turn. It's calling me
and I know what's in store for me.


01:21:42.682 --> 01:21:45.360
Misha!


01:22:13.775 --> 01:22:16.151
End of recording.


01:22:17.234 --> 01:22:21.560
Memory loading.
Laboratory minus 4.


01:22:25.773 --> 01:22:27.898
Everything is filmed.


01:22:28.091 --> 01:22:31.527
If your screws try to come back in
I'm warning you


01:22:31.628 --> 01:22:34.963
that I'll alert the world above
about what is happening here.


01:22:35.060 --> 01:22:37.450
And the faith reserved
by Eden Log


01:22:37.551 --> 01:22:39.840
for it's immigrant population.
There's still laws.


01:22:40.239 --> 01:22:42.840
On positions! Everything's ready.


01:22:43.000 --> 01:22:45.409
Let's go!


01:22:51.148 --> 01:22:54.189
Try to find a way
to get that working again.


01:22:54.305 --> 01:22:57.223
Request contact with the surface.
What's the situation?


01:22:57.435 --> 01:23:00.894
- And the plantation?
- It's completely choked up.


01:23:01.010 --> 01:23:04.840
The workers are in a terminal stage.
Gone completely wild.


01:23:05.000 --> 01:23:08.840
It's impossible to locate
the technician on level minus 3.


01:23:09.456 --> 01:23:13.050
His knowledge of the gallery
is a serious handicap.


01:23:15.532 --> 01:23:20.073
Recover the data from the laboratories.
The rest is left to your discretion.


01:23:20.440 --> 01:23:22.063
I see.


01:23:22.160 --> 01:23:26.334
Secrecy... Secrecy alone counts.


01:23:27.821 --> 01:23:30.840
Loading surveillance data: 20%.


01:23:30.971 --> 01:23:35.420
Get around it. The exterior is not yet
ready to accept the secret.


01:23:35.555 --> 01:23:38.705
- You've remained it's guardians.
- You're already on a mission.


01:23:38.840 --> 01:23:41.840
Control of the laboratories
and the technicians.


01:23:41.947 --> 01:23:44.265
Control of the technicians?
- It's a clean-up.


01:23:44.362 --> 01:23:47.319
I want images of all that!
Check your recorders.


01:23:47.415 --> 01:23:52.828
The signals that are broadcast...
- Loading surveillance data: 40%.


01:23:58.000 --> 01:24:01.720
Loading surveillance data: 70%


01:24:05.815 --> 01:24:09.196
Loading surveillance data: 90%


01:24:12.367 --> 01:24:16.800
Surveillance data loaded.
Reading surveillance data.


01:24:18.608 --> 01:24:21.025
Wil you be alright?


01:24:21.141 --> 01:24:23.840
I'll go see if the elevator is still stuck.


01:24:24.000 --> 01:24:26.640
Can you hold on?


01:24:36.404 --> 01:24:39.342
Requesting contact with the surface.


01:24:50.091 --> 01:24:53.028
The plantation is devastated.


01:24:54.787 --> 01:24:58.341
We're blocked below.
Do you copy?


01:25:04.216 --> 01:25:07.160
Nothing works any more.


01:25:12.899 --> 01:25:15.640
What the...


01:26:45.655 --> 01:26:49.385
Access to security archives authorized.


01:26:53.385 --> 01:26:55.880
Welcome, Tolbiac.


01:26:58.434 --> 01:27:01.236
Memory loading.


01:27:05.780 --> 01:27:09.468
The situation is critical. We've
intercepted images form the plantation.


01:27:09.569 --> 01:27:12.157
Attention all guards.


01:27:12.659 --> 01:27:16.960
By order of the council
prepare to go down


01:27:17.327 --> 01:27:20.071
and silence the plantation.


01:27:24.597 --> 01:27:27.840
End of the plantation revolt.


01:27:28.152 --> 01:27:31.040
Task completed.


01:27:31.766 --> 01:27:34.840
Elimination of the architect.


01:27:35.000 --> 01:27:37.680
Task completed.


01:27:39.245 --> 01:27:42.840
Access to the REZO
scientific observation laboratory.


01:27:43.245 --> 01:27:45.840
Task completed.


01:27:46.260 --> 01:27:48.840
Hey, you're back. Call the reenforcement.
It's Tolbiac...


01:27:48.958 --> 01:27:52.107
Mission terminated.


01:28:19.145 --> 01:28:23.976
The council is satisfied with the manner
in which you carried out this mission.


01:28:24.633 --> 01:28:27.236
The uprising of the plantation workers


01:28:27.337 --> 01:28:31.840
and the resistance of the REZO
were just unfortunate setbacks,


01:28:32.000 --> 01:28:34.832
that we are eager to rectify.


01:28:34.967 --> 01:28:37.840
You are the most apt
to secure the area


01:28:37.941 --> 01:28:41.113
of that is already the model
for a new enterprise.


01:28:41.229 --> 01:28:46.600
We must reintegrate the plantation.
We must retain control.


01:28:47.548 --> 01:28:51.120
Access to greenhouse authorized.


01:28:56.360 --> 01:28:59.025
Sir, we're ready to go down.


01:29:03.759 --> 01:29:06.580
Open it.


01:29:58.461 --> 01:30:01.514
You have enabled us
to preserve what's essential.


01:30:01.630 --> 01:30:04.530
To retain the secret,


01:30:04.630 --> 01:30:07.956
long enough for us to
make our citizens admit


01:30:08.057 --> 01:30:11.282
that their lives a part
of a new social order.


01:30:11.475 --> 01:30:15.622
For them to understand they need
courage to impose a solution


01:30:15.723 --> 01:30:19.770
on these faraway populations
and frustrated lands.


01:30:24.736 --> 01:30:28.357
All these men, these women...


01:30:28.493 --> 01:30:31.406
We have no choice but
to rely on hope


01:30:31.507 --> 01:30:34.320
for what we have never
been able to offer them.


01:30:36.241 --> 01:30:41.614
We need men like you - conscious
of the obligation, of the sacrifice


01:30:41.711 --> 01:30:45.093
which is essential to this new world.


01:31:08.000 --> 01:31:11.840
The time will come
when the secret will be useless.


01:31:12.000 --> 01:31:15.440
Our fellow citizens will
end up accepting that


01:31:15.541 --> 01:31:18.880
which our needs imposed
on these populations.


01:31:29.848 --> 01:31:33.229
After a long period of hardship and suffering


01:31:33.326 --> 01:31:39.840
at last a way to integrate
all these populations to our civilizations.


01:31:40.039 --> 01:31:45.237
- At last the return to Eden.
- For everybody.


01:34:46.160 --> 01:34:52.160
Subtitles by electroneon

